   "selection": "one shared orthonormal basis E (1024 x 768), the top eigenvectors of the evidence-pca second moment of the residual stream pooled over all 29 residual-write endpoints with each endpoint equalised to trace one; a per-boundary chart is not expressible in a stock child because the residual is a running sum with nowhere to put a chart transition.  The conv blocks' internal channels are a pivoted-Cholesky coreset of the parent's own, because Lfm2ShortConv gates channelwise and no rotation of that space is representable",
